{"id":20370,"author":"rami79","body":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHi, I was banned for almost 2 years now , and my friends have begun to play on Avicus again and I can not play because I am banned. Yes I know that I hacked but now I stopped to hack. I have not written in for you yet because I did not know you could write in to you . I apologize really many times to have fly hacked , used aimbot and kill aura. However, I stopped to hack now that I 've realized that you can win without a hack , but now I do not feel we deserve to win when you do it . When you play a game Hunger games or anything else , so I can not even self like those hackers . I hope you to see this Ban appeal- rami79\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eHi, I was banned for almost 2 years now , and my friends have begun to play on Avicus again and I can not play because I am banned. Yes I know that I hacked but now I stopped to hack. I have not written in for you yet because I did not know you could write in to you . I apologize really many times to have fly hacked , used aimbot and kill aura. However, I stopped to hack now that I 've realized that you can win without a hack , but now I do not feel we deserve to win when you do it . When you play a game Hunger games or anything else , so I can not even self like those hackers . I hope you to see this Ban appeal- rami79\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1455903627,"title":"i have been banned","replies":[{"id":280765,"author":"Protel","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif